1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,800
Meet Trako Order Exporter. This guide shows Shopee Philippines.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,600
Install Trako from the Chrome Web Store. Sign in normally and open My Purchases.
Trako never asks for your password.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:19,800
Load the orders you want: scroll and choose Load More when available.
Trako reads only orders currently loaded.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:33,800
Choose Export orders to CSV in Trako's on-page panel.
It checks each loaded order and exports completed orders only.
Progress and skipped-product reasons stay visible. Cancel, retry, or scan again any time.

5
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:45,800
When the scan finishes, save the CSV and open it in a spreadsheet.
Trako includes order details visible on the page.
Some dates or fields may be blank if Shopee does not show them in history.

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Your order data stays in your browser and is never sent to Trako servers.
Export your own history. Trako Order Exporter.
